  "mechanism": "POISSONKNICK qcal computes 30 strictly catalogue-free physical features (f01..f30; dist_known_fault_px dropped), trains a 4-quadrant Leave-One-Quadrant-Out (LOQO, >=1.2 km guard band, >500 m negative buffer) HistGradientBoostingClassifier, aligns per-quadrant probability and 1D crest survival quantiles on unlabeled footprint cells (restoring NE quadrant allocation from 6.4% uncalibrated / 0.1% BLINDFAULT / 11.2% COULOMBLOQO to 26.5% = 9,967 dots), and emits 37,654 spaced 1D crests (min_dist=2.8 px, d_cat > 2.0 px).",
